      "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images",
      "images": [
       {
        "alt": "Outside a handful of CEOs insisting that Huang must have been felled by some journalistic plot, even the oligarch class seemed largely indifferent to his departure. Altman declined to say Huang should return when asked; on Tuesday he replied to Huang’s tweet with a green heart emoji that could have meant almost anything. Amazon founder Jeff Bezos, asked the same question at a Semafor event on Tuesday, also demurred.\n\nHell, even the Denny’s restaurant where Nvidia was born removed the plaque commemorating Huang over the weekend. Robert E. Lee statues fared better. ",
